OL,3,GNEWSAParents whose baby died at five
OL,4,Adays old suing NHS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a baby who died when she
OL,7,Fwas five days old are launching a civil
OL,8,Fclaim against the NHS trust which runs
OL,9,Fthe hospital where she died.
OL,11,FOlivia Trupiano was born by emergency
OL,12,Fcaesarean section at 34 weeks on 14
OL,13,FSeptember 2024 at the Princess Royal
OL,14,FHospital in Haywards Heath, West
OL,15,FSussex.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
