OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParents whose baby died at five
OL,4,Adays old suing NHS
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest this month concluded that no
OL,7,Faspects of Olivia's care by the
OL,8,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex NHS Trust
OL,9,Fcould be considered likely to have
OL,10,Fcaused her death, but parents Kimberley
OL,11,FNewark and Yann Trupiano said they
OL,12,Fremain determined to get answers.
OL,14,FNewark, from Brighton, said: "It's sort
OL,15,Fof, I feel, the only thing that I can
OL,16,Freally do for Olivia as her mother."
